{"schema_version":1,"stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a11814-044b-79a3-89ab-834247f64344"},"sequence":70,"recorded_at":1791405330751488,"payload_type":"runtime.session","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"run","run_id":"5328b548-b874-422b-92bd-d17a82b15b63","event":{"kind":"tool_result_batch_committed","batch_id":"6f6db2c4-d27f-4207-b9f6-f16566ef39ca","results":[{"tool_call_index":0,"tool_call_id":"call_01a118140c66778e9cc993204aedc72d","text":"{\"query\":\"Supabase documentation Row Level Security\",\"results\":[{\"url\":\"https://github.com/justasallen/5th_row/blob/HEAD/.opencode/skills/supabase-backend/SKILL.md\",\"title\":\"justasallen/5th_row - .opencode/skills/supabase-backend/SKILL.md\",\"snippet\":\"supabase.storage.from(\\\"avatars\\\").list(); ... Row Level Security (RLS) - IMPORTANT\",\"page_last_modified\":1790175232},{\"url\":\"https://supabase.com/docs/guides/database/postgres/row-level-security?ref=javorszky.co.uk\",\"title\":\"Row Level Security | Supabase Docs\",\"snippet\":\"alter table <schema_name>.<table_name>enable row level security; ... RLS can be combined with [Supabase Auth](https://supabase.com/docs/guides/auth) for end-to-end user security from the browser to the database.\",\"page_last_modified\":1744993920},{\"url\":\"https://supabase.com/docs/guides/troubleshooting/rls-simplified-BJTcS8\",\"title\":\"Supabase Docs | Troubleshooting | RLS Simplified\",\"snippet\":\"Supabase Docs | Troubleshooting | RLS Simplified\\nRow-Level Security (RLS) Policy: A `WHERE` or `CHECK` condition applied automatically to database queries\\nKey features:\\n- Applies without being explicitly added to each query, which makes it good for policing row access from unknown entities, such as those leveraging the anon or authenticated roles.\",\"page_last_modified\":1791331200},{\"url\":\"https://github.com/kuker24/opencodebestfriend/blob/HEAD/skills/supabase-ops/SKILL.md\",\"title\":\"kuker24/opencodebestfriend - skills/supabase-ops/SKILL.md\",\"snippet\":\"**Official Documentation via Context7:** ... - Fetch verified API contracts from Context7 for `@supabase/supabase-js` or `@supabase/ssr`. ... **RLS & Security Enforcement:** ... - Ensure Row Level Security (`ALTER TABLE ... ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY;`) is enabled on all tables exposed to the client.\",\"page_last_modified\":1789681664},{\"url\":\"https://codingcapybaras.com/blog/supabase-row-level-security-tutorial\",\"title\":\"Supabase Row Level Security: A 2026 Tutorial\",\"snippet\":\"This is the number-one way a table ends up publicly readable: the migration created the table, nobody added the `enable row level security` line, and the app worked fine in testing because the data was flowing. ... Supabase documents an event trigger that automatically enables RLS on any new table created in the `public` schema, so a forgotten migration can't leave a table exposed:\",\"page_last_modified\":1785715200},{\"url\":\"https://github.com/romanyrefaat1/my-portfolio/blob/HEAD/content [trimmed]"}]},"source_run_record_id":"526be856-7170-52f4-93cb-9dafbd2564af","source_run_record_sequence":26}}
